      "parameters": {
        "content": "### {{CLINIC_NAME}} - Staff Onboarding & Social Media Automation (PET WF10)\n\n**🎯 Purpose:** Streamline new staff onboarding process while maintaining engaging social media presence with AI-generated content\n\n**🚀 Features:**\n• **Staff Onboarding Pipeline:** Welcome emails, training resources, and follow-up communications\n• **Progress Tracking:** Google Sheets integration for onboarding status monitoring\n• **Social Media Automation:** Weekly AI-generated pet care tips for Facebook and Twitter/X\n• **Content Intelligence:** OpenAI-powered content generation with clinic branding\n• **Multi-Platform Publishing:** Simultaneous posting across social channels\n\n**⚡ Workflow Triggers:**\n• **Staff Onboarding:** Manual webhook trigger for new staff members\n• **Social Media:** Weekly scheduled trigger (Mondays at 9:00 AM)\n\n**📊 Integration Points:**\n• Staff Database: {{STAFF_SHEET_ID}}\n• Social Media: Facebook Page {{FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID}}, Twitter Account {{TWITTER_HANDLE}}\n• Content Generation: OpenAI API for pet care tips\n• Email System: SMTP via {{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}\n\n**⚙️ Configuration:**\n• Clinic: {{CLINIC_NAME}}\n• Onboarding Timeline: Welcome → Day 3 Training → Day 10 Follow-up\n• Social Schedule: Mondays 9:00 AM {{TIMEZONE}}\n• Content Theme: Pet care tips, seasonal advice, clinic updates\n• Brand Voice: {{BRAND_VOICE_TONE}}",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 5
